2. Free and Pro tiers
   a. Free tier. Without a license key the Software runs in the Free tier
      (up to 5 simulated DHCP clients and at most a single 802.1Q VLAN tag).
      The Free tier may be used at no charge.
   b. Pro tier. A purchased license key (a "PP1" token) unlocks the Pro tier
      (up to 1000 simulated DHCP clients, QinQ, saved profiles and export) for
      the term shown in the key. A key is licensed to the purchaser, may be
      used by that purchaser on the devices they control, and must not be
      shared, resold, published, or used to build a key generator.
   c. Fees are non-refundable except where required by law or stated in the
      refund terms shown at the time of purchase.

3. Authorized use only
   PathProbe sends real network traffic, including DHCP requests that can use
   up the address pool of a DHCP server, ARP/NDP, ICMP, and raw frames. You may
   use the Software only on networks and devices that you own or for which you
   have explicit written permission to test. You are solely responsible for
   obtaining that permission and for complying with all applicable laws,
   contracts, and acceptable-use policies. You must not use the Software to
   disrupt, attack, or gain unauthorized access to any network, system, or
   service.

